    "_summary": "A drag and drop game for kids!",
    "_description": "# Animal Match\n\nMatch animals to their silhouettes.\n\n{height=300}![screenshot](Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker/Editor/Addons/Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker.samples.animal-match.jpg)\n\n## Features\n\nThe sample shows how to:\n\n- Drag and drop UI Images.\n- Customize prefabs to show different images.\n- Play different sounds based on state.\n- Use a global variable to count matches.\n- Use global events to communicate between FSMs.\n- Detect a victory condition - all animals matched!\n\n## Reference\n\n- [UI System Events](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/guides/system-events/#ui-events) to detect drag events.\n- [Get Pointer Event Data](action:PointerEventDataGetPointerDrag) to check the dragged image.\n- [Global variables](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/welcome/core-concepts/variables/#global-variables) and [events](https://hutonggames.com/playmaker/docs/welcome/core-concepts/events/#global-events).\n- [Send Event to GameObject](action:SendEventToGameObject).\n",
